es is ability text. || PSIONICS (#5): Detect Psionics and Sense Evil granted, three powers from Physical and/or Sensitive, one more per level from either. The book states no tier; stored major (judgement: non-Super picks from two categories). I.S.P. 1D4x10 + M.E., no gain with experience. || SKILLS: Dowsing 20+15, Language four of choice (+30%) as a choose-4 Language: Other, Land Navigation 36+30, Lore: Demons & Monsters 25+25 (printed Lore: Demon & Monster), Lore: Magic 25+15, Prowl 25+15 (+25% underwater is a note), Swimming 98% fixed, Tailing 30+20, Tracking (people) 25+20, Track & Trap Animals 20+15 (printed Track Animals), Wilderness Survival 30+30, Wrestling, and one Modern W.P. of choice (the modern W.P. rows, judgement). SECONDARY: three at level two, plus one at levels 4, 8, 10, 12 and 14; none at level one. || SPECIAL POWERS #1-#4, #6 and #7 have no catalog rows and are special abilities with their printed figures; the Track base 24% +4% per level is inside Sense Psychic and Magic Energy. || BIO-ARMOR is a power, not gear: its M.D.C. and built-in weapons are statted inside the Bio-Armor ability; no gear row exists or is created. || EQUIPMENT and MONEY: none. || NOT STORED: size 6 to 8 feet, weight 200 to 320 lbs, life span 6D6+110, allies and enemies; GM Notes."
